OL,3,ATraitors claim their first victim as
OL,4,ARichard E Grant tries to save his skin
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpoiler warning: This article reveals
OL,7,Fdetails from the second episode of The
OL,8,FCelebrity Traitors, series two.
OL,10,FA comedian, a journalist, an actor and
OL,11,Fa TV presenter walk into a church. But
OL,12,Fsadly, the punchline for one of them
OL,13,Fwas becoming the first victim of this
OL,14,Fyear's Celebrity Traitors.
OL,16,FAs Friday's episode got under way, a
OL,17,Fdelicious new twist saw traitors
OL,18,FRichard E Grant and Maya Jama invite
OL,19,FJames Acaster to join them in the
OL,20,Fturret, and simultaneously murder a
OL,21,Ffellow player.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/19
