OL,3,AAlison Hammond has heart check-up in
OL,4,Ahospital after rushing off This Morning
OL,5,Awhile on air
OL,6,
OL,7,FAlison Hammond went to hospital for a
OL,8,Fheart check-up after leaving ITV's This
OL,9,FMorning midway through Friday's show,
OL,10,Fbut has assured followers she is
OL,11,F"fine".
OL,13,FThe presenter, 51, left the programme
OL,14,Fduring its live broadcast, appearing to
OL,15,Fclutch her chest as she was assisted
OL,16,Foff the set by co-host Dermot O'Leary.
OL,17,FHe later told viewers she was "feeling
OL,18,Fa little unwell".
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,164,160,200,105,0,100
PN,11915
SC,0015
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1791033527
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+j 55"k#j 5w;js1
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AAlison Hammond has heart check-up in
OL,4,Ahospital after rushing off This Morning
OL,5,Awhile on air
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn a video posted from a hospital bed
OL,8,Fon Friday afternoon, Hammond said she
OL,9,Fhad "a little bit of a palpitation"
OL,10,Fduring the show but was feeling OK and
OL,11,Fwas undergoing tests.
OL,13,F"I know you're all worried about me,"
OL,14,Fshe said. "Honestly, I am fine. First
OL,15,Fof all, I'm getting my old ticker
OL,16,Fchecked out."
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/19
